tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-252-a-library-name-no-windows-linker-reads-as-one-file.hero:22:23: error[unwritable_name]: this library's name holds `>`, which no file's name on Windows can hold, so `a>b` does not name one file on every machine: write the name without it, as `link "m"`
