tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-252-a-library-name-no-windows-linker-reads-as-one-file.hero:43:26: error[package_comparison]: this package's name holds `=`, which is how `pkg-config` writes a version's comparison, and a group names a package and no version: write the package's name alone, as `package "raylib"`
